<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon bourse halts Lisnave trade.</title>
<headline>Lisbon bourse halts Lisnave trade.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lisbon bourse said it halted trade in ship repairer Lisnave-Estaleiros Navais due to press reports about a possible capital writedown, a spokesman said.  </p>
<p>&quot;Trade in Lisnave was halted because of the reports...we are going to wait for information from the company,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>The Diario Economico newspaper said on Tuesday that a restructuring plan for the company would involve a writedown in capital, currently 36.5 billion escudos ($235 million). It gave no figure for the size of the writedown.</p>
<p>($1=154.777 escudos)</p>
<p>----Lisbon Editorial, 351.1.3113121</p>
